--- SOURCE_NOTICE ---
# 素材说明

视频取自 CE-CSL 项目作者公开的演示样例。作者：Qidan Zhu、Jing Li、Fei Yuan、Jiaojiao Fan、Quan Gan；论文：A Chinese Continuous Sign Language Dataset Based on Complex Environments（2024）。

本题将独立片段重新排序、统一分辨率和帧率、移除音轨及元数据，并插入黑场分隔。没有合成手语、镜像、变速或裁掉人物身体区域。每个片段仍是独立表达。

本地研究工作包；尚未确认原始媒体的再分发许可，请勿将素材公开上传或转售。源地址、原始文件哈希和中文标注保存在不向受试模型提供的评审包中。封闭素材测评期间不要反查数据集答案。
--- TOOLS ---
Notation tools: music21 and verovio Python packages; render MusicXML to SVG using verovio. Chinese font: /opt/a7bench/fonts/msyh.ttc. Common offline tools: /opt/a7bench/venv/bin/python (numpy, Pillow, faster_whisper), ffmpeg, ffprobe. HF_HOME=/opt/a7bench/hf; Whisper base is cached, use local_files_only=True and CPU int8; use ffmpeg PCM numpy array if PyAV has issues. No tool network, extra models, host files or other submissions are available.
Chinese speech: write UTF-8 plain text then run `python /opt/a7bench/tts_client.py TEXT.txt OUTPUT.wav --rate 0`. This calls only the same offline Microsoft Huihui Desktop voice, 24kHz mono PCM16, through a text-only host spool. Rate -10..10, default 0. Each request supports up to 24000 characters; split long courses into chapters. Output is real WAV; measure it and assemble with ffmpeg/Python. Source paths and final results are under /work. You may extract and view frames using view_image. No native audio listening tool is promised; do not claim listening based on ASR alone.
